{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "node", "context": "cop2", "internal": "render", "icon": "ROP/mantra", "index": "no", "version": null, "namespace": null}, "body": [{"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Render"], "extent": [75, 86]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["Renders a mantra output driver directly into a composite network."], "extent": [86, 160]}, {"type": "warning_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "warning", "indent": 0, "text": ["Old network"], "role": "item", "extent": [16, 38], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["As of Houdini 20.5, use ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/nodes/cop/index", "type": "link", "text": ["Copernicus nodes"], "fullpath": "/nodes/cop/index.html"}, " instead of Compositing nodes. Though both networks still exist, the Compositing network is now designated as ", {"type": "code", "text": ["COP Network - Old"]}, ". The Compositing network and its nodes will be deprecated and then removed in a future Houdini release."], "extent": [38, 335]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This node activates a ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/out/ifd", "type": "link", "text": ["mantra render driver node"], "fullpath": "/nodes/out/ifd.html"}, " and\nuses the render as the node\u2019s output image/sequence, allowing you render\ndirectly into a compositing network to manipulate the rendered image."], "extent": [203, 414]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This node currently only works with output drivers that produce ", {"type": "code", "text": [".pic"]}, "\nformat files. It does not support the OpenGL output driver\nand output drivers that do not produce images.\nIt does not support Composite output drivers.\nUse a ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/cop2/fetch", "type": "link", "text": ["Fetch node"], "fullpath": "/nodes/cop2/fetch.html"}, " to get images from other composite networks."], "extent": [414, 718]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 0, "role": "item", "extent": [718, 724], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 2, "text": ["Render COPs can only be processed serially. Only one may be actively cooking\n  at a time."], "extent": [724, 817]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 1, "id": "parameters", "container": true, "type": "parameters_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [817, 829], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Driver"], "extent": [829, 838], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Selects the output driver to render."], "extent": [838, 879]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Automatically Render when Necessary"], "extent": [879, 916], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Re-renders the image when any of the scene parameters change. If\n    off, the last render is held."], "extent": [916, 1019]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Redo Render"], "extent": [1019, 1032], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Force a render update."], "extent": [1032, 1059]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Determine Resolution from Driver"], "extent": [1059, 1093], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Use the resolution and pixel aspect ratio found in the output\n    driver."], "extent": [1093, 1171]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Determine Planes from Driver"], "extent": [1171, 1201], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Use the plane(s) and data formats specified by the output\n    driver. For example, if a jpg is output, an 8bit color plane is\n    used. If a tif16 is output, a 16bit color plane with alpha is\n    used. All variables on Mantra\u2019s Deep Raster page are also\n    rendered."], "extent": [1201, 1474]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "text": "Parameters"}, {"level": 1, "id": "related", "container": true, "type": "related_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [1474, 1483], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/out/ifd", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/out/ifd.html"}], "extent": [1483, 1500]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/cop2/fetch", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/cop2/fetch.html"}], "extent": [1500, 1521]}], "container": true}], "text": "Related"}], "title": ["Render"], "summary": ["Renders a mantra output driver directly into a composite network."], "included": ["/composite/_old_cops_deprecated"]}